<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>Why the Oreo Blizzard Cake Is DQ's #1</h2>
  <p>The Oreo® Blizzard® Cake is DQ's most-ordered celebration cake by a significant margin — mirroring the Oreo Cookie Blizzard's position as the #1 Blizzard. When guests want to bring a DQ dessert to a birthday, graduation, or celebration, the Oreo Blizzard Cake is the default choice. Find the full DQ cake lineup and pricing on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>How It Differs from the Classic DQ Cake</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th></th><th>Oreo® Blizzard® Cake</th><th>Classic DQ Cake</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>10-inch Price</td><td class="price-cell">$38.74+</td><td class="price-cell">$32.99+</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Soft Serve Flavor</td><td>Oreo Blizzard soft serve (Oreo pieces throughout)</td><td>Standard vanilla/chocolate DQ soft serve</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Mix-In Pieces</td><td>Real Oreo cookie pieces throughout the cake</td><td>None</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Best For</td><td>Oreo fans, showpiece celebration</td><td>Classic flavor, more budget-friendly</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>How to Order the Oreo Blizzard Cake</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Call or visit your local DQ</strong> at least 48 hours before your event</li>
    <li><strong>Specify:</strong> Oreo® Blizzard® Cake, 10-inch round</li>
    <li><strong>Add your personalized message</strong> — included at no extra charge</li>
    <li><strong>Photo toppers</strong> — available at select locations, call to confirm</li>
    <li><strong>Pick up at least 30 minutes before your event</strong> to allow time for any adjustments</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Related Items</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/dq-cake-round-8inch">Classic DQ Cake 8-inch — $22.99+</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/dq-sheet-cake">DQ Sheet Cake — $44.99+ (serves 24–32)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/oreo-blizzard">Oreo Cookie Blizzard (individual) — from $3.49</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/dq-cakes">All DQ Cake Options</a></li>
  </ul>
